                <label>🎀🍭❤️ Review Score ❤️🍭🎀</label>
                <div class="hearts-container" id="hearts-container">
                    <span class="heart" data-score="1">&#9733;</span>
                    <span class="heart" data-score="1.5">&#9733;</span>
                    <span class="heart" data-score="2">&#9733;</span>
